ates\nand fees.  Lastly, this legislation will create savings for local social\nservice districts by eliminating the need to issue paper checks and the\ntime associated with such tasks.\n\n \nPRIOR LEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\nNew bill\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS FOR STATE AND LOCAL GOVERNMENTS:\n\nTo be determined.\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nThis act shall take effect immediately.\n",
